// resetPool drops the contexts currently kept by the pool. Contexts preallocate
// their params and skippedNodes slices with the maxParams and maxSections values
// known when they are allocated, so contexts allocated before a route was added
// are too small to store the parameters of that route. Dropping them makes sure
